    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d369">

                <pb facs="0498" n="413" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg413"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.6512/27</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Italian Embassy to the Department of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p>The Arbitration Convention of March 28, 1908 between Italy and the United States
                    was renewed, by an Agreement between the two countries signed on May 28,
                        1913,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d369-f1"/> for a period of five years.</p>
                <p>The Royal Italian Government, in view of the fact that the said period will
                    expire on January 22nd, 1919, would be pleased to renew the Convention again for
                    the duration of five years.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 18, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
